{{!< default}}
{{#contentFor "moHead"}}
<title>New Writers Meetings | Mere Orthodoxy</title>
<meta name="description" content="One-hour conversations over Zoom for writers who have pitched Mere Orthodoxy or want to. Each meeting reads one published essay closely." />
<meta property="og:title" content="New Writers Meetings" />
<meta property="og:description" content="One-hour conversations over Zoom for writers who have pitched Mere Orthodoxy or want to. Each meeting reads one published essay closely." />
<meta name="twitter:title" content="New Writers Meetings" />
<meta name="twitter:description" content="One-hour conversations over Zoom for writers who have pitched Mere Orthodoxy or want to. Each meeting reads one published essay closely." />
{{/contentFor}}
{{!-- /writers-meetings/ is routed via routes.yaml. Public, not member-gated.
     Editorial layout matching custom-about.hbs: dark hero, dropcap lede,
     left-aligned section intros on the 640px prose measure. Page CSS is
     scoped under .writers-meetings.

     Between rounds (2026-11-10): the fall round (Sept 8, Oct 6, Nov 3) is
     over and the next dates are not set. The date cards say "to be
     announced" and the sign-up below collects interest through the site's
     inline signup (assets/js/inline-signup.js), which labels the Ghost
     member source:writers-meetings (mirrored to a Kit tag). Email that tag
     when the dates are set.

     When dates are set: fill the three cards, add the dates to
     WRITERS_MEETING_LABELS and WRITERS_MEETING_GFORM_OPTIONS in
     workers/forms/forms.js and to the Google Form's "Meeting Attending"
     question (byte-identical), then restore the RSVP form (git history,
     commit before this one) with radios for the new keys. RSVPs write to
     D1 writers_meetings_registrations, the email and the Google sheet. --}}

<main class="writers-meetings">

  <section class="hero writers-meetings-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="hero-kicker"><span class="dot"></span> New Writers Meetings</p>
      <h1 class="hero-headline">An invitation to <span class="highlight"><em>write with us</em></span>.</h1>
      <p class="hero-sub">Conversations over Zoom for writers who have pitched <em>Mere&nbsp;Orthodoxy</em> and for writers who want to.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="writers-meetings-body">
    <div class="container container-narrow">

      <div class="about-prose">
        <p class="about-lede">Most of what we publish comes from writers we have never met. An essay arrives and an editor reads it. A note goes back. A working relationship begins without anyone saying hello. These meetings are a better way to start.</p>
        <p>Each meeting is one hour on Zoom. You meet the editors and the other writers. Then we read one published essay together and talk about how it works.</p>
      </div>

      <dl class="writers-meetings-facts">
        <div class="writers-meetings-fact">
          <dt>Next dates</dt>
          <dd>To be announced</dd>
        </div>
        <div class="writers-meetings-fact">
          <dt>Length</dt>
          <dd>One hour on Zoom</dd>
        </div>
        <div class="writers-meetings-fact">
          <dt>Cost</dt>
          <dd>Free and open to anyone</dd>
        </div>
        <div class="writers-meetings-fact">
          <dt>To prepare</dt>
          <dd>Read one essay in about ten minutes</dd>
        </div>
      </dl>

      <div class="section-intro">
        <h2 class="section-heading"><em>An open invitation.</em></h2>
      </div>
      <div class="about-prose">
        <p>You do not need to have written for us. You do not need to be a member. If you have pitched an essay, this is for you. If you have meant to pitch and have not yet, this is for you too. There is no application. Come to one meeting or come to all of them.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="section-intro">
        <h2 class="section-heading"><em>One essay read closely.</em></h2>
      </div>
      <div class="about-prose">
        <p>Each meeting reads one essay we have published. We send it to you beforehand. We talk through the questions an editor asks: what the piece argues, where it earns the reader's attention and what would make it stronger. One essay read closely teaches more than a page of guidelines.</p>
        <p>If you arrive without having read it, come anyway.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="flourish"></div>

      <div class="section-intro">
        <h2 class="section-heading"><em>The next meetings.</em></h2>
      </div>
    </div>

    {{!-- Three cards in a row on a wider measure than the prose; they
          stack on a phone. Fill each with its date and reading when set. --}}
    <div class="container">
      <ol class="wm-dates">
        <li class="wm-date">
          <span class="wm-date-numeral" aria-hidden="true">I</span>
          <p class="wm-date-when">Date to be announced</p>
          <p class="wm-date-meta">One hour on Zoom</p>
          <p class="wm-date-reading">Reading to be announced</p>
        </li>
        <li class="wm-date">
          <span class="wm-date-numeral" aria-hidden="true">II</span>
          <p class="wm-date-when">Date to be announced</p>
          <p class="wm-date-meta">One hour on Zoom</p>
          <p class="wm-date-reading">Reading to be announced</p>
        </li>
        <li class="wm-date">
          <span class="wm-date-numeral" aria-hidden="true">III</span>
          <p class="wm-date-when">Date to be announced</p>
          <p class="wm-date-meta">One hour on Zoom</p>
          <p class="wm-date-reading">Reading to be announced</p>
        </li>
      </ol>
    </div>

    <div class="container container-narrow">
      <div class="section-intro" id="register">
        <h2 class="section-heading"><em>Hear about the next dates.</em></h2>
      </div>
      <div class="writers-meetings-form-panel">
        <p class="writers-meetings-form-intro">Leave your name and email. We will send you the dates and the readings when they are set.</p>
        <div class="site-form" data-inline-signup data-source="writers-meetings" data-signup-confirmation="Open it to confirm your email. We will send the dates when they are set.">
          <div class="site-form-row">
            <div class="site-form-field">
              <label for="wm-first">First name</label>
              <input id="wm-first" type="text" autocomplete="given-name" data-signup-first required />
            </div>
            <div class="site-form-field">
              <label for="wm-last">Last name</label>
              <input id="wm-last" type="text" autocomplete="family-name" data-signup-last required />
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="site-form-field">
            <label for="wm-email">Email</label>
            <input id="wm-email" type="email" autocomplete="email" inputmode="email" data-signup-email required />
          </div>
          <button type="button" class="btn btn-solid wm-submit" data-signup-submit>Keep me posted</button>
          <p class="site-form-status" data-signup-status role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="about-prose writers-meetings-footnote">
        <p>You do not need to come to a meeting first. If you have an essay ready now, <a href="/submissions/">send us a pitch</a>.</p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

</main>
